The user name you use to login to your news server does not appear in
any normal header. The name and e-mail address you've chosen to use as
your From: header do, as do the same details in Reply-to:, but they
don't need to be related at all to your news server user name. In my
case, for example, my news.individual.net username is not rlb.
Some servers seem to use the user name for generating Message-IDs, but
